67,3,1,talk,May,,I'm totally on board with Ledger Bridge! It's the only one that doesn't look like a cash-hungry monster. No warehouses or sensors means fewer scary follow-on calls and a much safer ride for our reserves.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
