69,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I concur. Ledger Bridge is the only logical choice. Fabric Loop and Harvest Sensor rely on physical supply chains, and Clinic Scheduler handles medical records, which my data shows leads to severe security review delays. Ledger Bridge offers the most unobstructed path to deployment.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
