71,3,2,talk,George,,"It is a rare and satisfying thing to reach such a complete consensus. By prioritizing a lean model and avoiding operational friction, we are making a decision grounded in the actual history of our returns. I am ready to vote.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
