74,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. The alignment here is based on a shared desire to eliminate systemic risk. Ledger Bridge avoids the regulatory hurdles of medical data and the volatility of hardware supply chains. I am ready to vote.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited! Let's do this! I'm casting my vote for Ledger Bridge because it's the only one that won't leave us scrambling for people we can't find. I vote for Ledger Bridge!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
